#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "About {nameApp}"
msgstr "About {nameApp}"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "Welcome to {nameApp} – your mobile companion in the world of cars and motorcycles! This app is designed for those who want to easily and conveniently buy and sell vehicle parts, as well as vehicles themselves, gear, and much more."
msgstr "Welcome to {nameApp} – your mobile companion in the world of cars and motorcycles! This app is designed for those who want to easily and conveniently buy and sell vehicle parts, as well as vehicles themselves, gear, and much more."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "Key features of the app:"
msgstr "Key features of the app:"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "Trading Parts and Vehicles: You can post ads for selling or buying parts, vehicles, and gear."
msgstr "Trading Parts and Vehicles: You can post ads for selling or buying parts, vehicles, and gear."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "Workshop Finder: Easily find the necessary workshop or service station, read reviews about them, or add your own workshop."
msgstr "Workshop Finder: Easily find the necessary workshop or service station, read reviews about them, or add your own workshop."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "Events and Activities: Discover exciting events in the auto and moto world, such as festivals, competitions, and meetups. You can also create your own events."
msgstr "Events and Activities: Discover exciting events in the auto and moto world, such as festivals, competitions, and meetups. You can also create your own events."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "Map: Find nearby workshops, events, and ads."
msgstr "Map: Find nearby workshops, events, and ads."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "Shops: If you have a store with auto or moto products, you can add your merchandise and offer it to other users."
msgstr "Shops: If you have a store with auto or moto products, you can add your merchandise and offer it to other users."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "We are always striving to improve our app and make it even better for you. Therefore, we would appreciate your feedback and suggestions for its enhancement. Together, we can take {nameApp} to the next level!"
msgstr "We are always striving to improve our app and make it even better for you. Therefore, we would appreciate your feedback and suggestions for its enhancement. Together, we can take {nameApp} to the next level!"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "Thank you for choosing {nameApp}!"
msgstr "Thank you for choosing {nameApp}!"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "How to delete personal data?"
msgstr "How to delete personal data?"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "If you wish to have your personal data deleted from the Moto Auto Road Assistant (M.A.R.A.) mobile application and website, you need to access the application, proceed to your profile, then go to the profile settings. At the top left corner, you will find the \"Delete\" button. After pressing it, your account will be deleted along with all your publications. Then, you will be redirected to the \"Welcome\" page where you can register again."
msgstr "If you wish to have your personal data deleted from the Moto Auto Road Assistant (M.A.R.A.) mobile application and website, you need to access the application, proceed to your profile, then go to the profile settings. At the top left corner, you will find the \"Delete\" button. After pressing it, your account will be deleted along with all your publications. Then, you will be redirected to the \"Welcome\" page where you can register again."

